ap;\">⭐ 4.65</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #334155; white-space: nowrap;\">プラン参照</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; text-align: center; white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F158422%2F158422.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #d97706; color: #fff; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none;\">空室・最安値 ➔</a></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\">\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f766e; white-space: nowrap;\">7位</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b;\"><a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F39705%2F39705.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0f766e; text-decoration: underline;\">草津温泉　ホテル一井</a></td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #d97706; white-space: nowrap;\">⭐ 4.63</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #334155; white-space: nowrap;\">¥18,700〜</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; text-align: center; white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F39705%2F39705.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #d97706; color: #fff; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none;\">空室・最安値 ➔</a></td>\n          </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【群馬県の有名なもの完全ガイド】観光名所・ご当地グルメ・定番お土産・地酒ランキング</h2>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">群馬県の誇る雄大な自然美と歴史ある街並み、名湯温泉、絶品ご当地グルメを満喫できる人気観光ハブ。</p>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-orange-50/50 border border-amber-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-amber-950 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2\">群馬県のハイライト＆名物グルメ</h3>\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-stone-200\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900 block mb-1\">📌 主要な観光ハイライト</strong>\n      <p class=\"text-stone-600\">草津温泉・伊香保温泉名所・群馬県名物・絶景温泉</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-stone-200\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900 block mb-1\">🍴 代表的なご当地グルメ</strong>\n      <p class=\"text-stone-600\">群馬県上州牛すき焼き・水沢うどん・おっきりこみ・焼きまんじゅう</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">群馬県で絶対に訪れるべき有名な観光名所</h3>\n<div class=\"space-y-3 my-4\">\n        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">1</span>\n            草津温泉（湯畑）\n</h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">日本三名泉の一つで自然湧出量日本一を誇る温泉街のシンボル。毎分4,000リットルの源泉が湯滝となって湧き出し、湯もみ体験や夜のライトアップも人気です。</p>\n        </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">2</span>\n            伊香保温泉（石段街）\n</h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">365段の石段が続く情緒溢れる温泉街。石段の両脇には射的場や土産物店、足湯が立ち並び、温泉まんじゅう発祥の地としても知られています。</p>\n        </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">3</span>\n            富岡製糸場\n</h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">明治政府が設立した日本初の本格的な製糸工場であり、世界文化遺産。木骨レンガ造りの巨大な繰糸所や蚕室が良好に保存されており、日本の近代化の足跡を辿れます。</p>\n        </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">4</span>\n            吹割の滝（ふきわれのたき）\n</h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">「東洋のナイアガラ」と称されるダイナミックな滝。巨大な岩盤が割れ目の中に河川の水が吸い込まれるように流れ落ちる迫力ある景観が魅力です。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">群馬県で喜ばれる人気定番お土産（日持ち・個包装）</h3>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 my-4\">\n        <div class=\"p-3.5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1\">\n            <strong class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-900\">🎁 群馬県 伝統銘菓「特製和菓子」</strong>\n            <span class=\"text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 bg-stone-100 text-stone-600 rounded-md font-semibold\">伝統銘菓</span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">群馬県で長年愛される伝統銘菓。しっとりした上品な甘みと職人技が光る極上手土産。</p>\n        </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"p-3.5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1\">\n            <strong class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-900\">🎁 群馬県 トレンド高級ラングドシャ</strong>\n            <span class=\"text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 bg-stone-100 text-stone-600 rounded-md font-semibold\">洋菓子・和モダン</span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">群馬県産厳選素材をたっぷり使用。サクサク食感ととろけるチョコレートが絶品。</p>\n        </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"p-3.5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1\">\n            <strong class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-900\">🎁 群馬県 ご当地名産グルメセット</strong>\n            <span class=\"text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 bg-stone-100 text-stone-600 rounded-md font-semibold\">名産グルメ</span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">群馬県の豊かな海・山の恵みをそのまま詰めたご飯のお供＆お酒の最高のアテ。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">群馬県の銘醸酒・日本酒酒蔵ランキング</h3>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 my-4\">\n        <div class=\"p-3.5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1\">\n            <strong class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-900\">🍶 群馬県 至高の純米大吟醸</strong>\n            <span class=\"text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 rounded-md font-semibold\">群馬県名門蔵元</span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">群馬県の名水と極上酒米で醸す。フルーティーな吟醸香とキレのある余韻が広がる最高峰。</p>\n        </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"p-3.5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1\">\n            <strong class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-900\">🍶 群馬県 伝統伝承の特別純米</strong>\n            <span class=\"text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 rounded-md font-semibold\">群馬県歴史蔵</span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">お米本来のふくよかな香りとキレのある後味。群馬県の名物郷土料理と見事に調和する格別の一杯。</p>\n        </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"p-3.5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify